# Origins the headless auto-update agent may contact: scripts/fetch
# refuses any other (including as a redirect hop), and the wrapper
# grants WebFetch only for these hosts. One scheme://host[:port] per
# line, matched exactly -- no wildcards, no paths. Lines starting with
# `#` are comments.
#
# Keep this to the sources the CLAUDE.md recipes read. A host listed
# here can receive whatever the agent puts in a URL, so add a vendor's
# advisory site only when a recipe needs it, and drop the sections
# this tracker has no rows for.

# Upstream PHP: release index, ChangeLog, announcements; the php-src
# advisories through the GitHub REST API
https://www.php.net
https://api.github.com

# CVE records and KEV
https://cveawg.mitre.org
https://services.nvd.nist.gov
https://www.cisa.gov

# Debian
https://security-tracker.debian.org
https://metadata.ftp-master.debian.org
https://snapshot.debian.org
https://tracker.debian.org

# NixOS (channels.nixos.org redirects to releases.nixos.org)
https://channels.nixos.org
https://releases.nixos.org
